 end="00:35.034">Back </span><span begin="00:35.034" end="00:35.804">then </span><span begin="00:37.554" end="00:37.904">we </span><span begin="00:37.904" end="00:38.264">were </span><span begin="00:38.264" end="00:38.964">like </span><span begin="00:38.964" end="00:40.544">cavemen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.124" end="00:45.643"><span begin="00:42.124" end="00:42.324">But </span><span begin="00:42.324" end="00:42.654">we </span><span begin="00:42.654" end="00:43.064">map </span><span begin="00:43.064" end="00:43.404">the </span><span begin="00:43.404" end="00:44.323">moon </span><span begin="00:44.323" end="00:44.543">and </span><span begin="00:44.543" end="00:44.743">the </span><span begin="00:44.743" end="00:45.643">stars</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.793" end="00:50.382"><span begin="00:46.793" end="00:47.303">Then </span><span begin="00:47.303" end="00:47.753">we </span><span begin="00:47.753" end="00:49.153">forgave </span><span begin="00:49.153" end="00:50.382">them</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.432" end="00:57.320"><span begin="00:53.432" end="00:53.612">We </span><span begin="00:53.612" end="00:53.852">will </span><span begin="00:53.852" end="00:54.482">meet </span><span begin="00:54.482" end="00:55.721">you </span><span begin="00:55.721" end="00:55.941">where </span><span begin="00:55.941" end="00:56.191">the </span><span begin="00:56.191" end="00:56.801">lights </span><span begin="00:56.801" end="00:57.320">are</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.090" end="01:02.090"><span begin="00:58.090" end="00:58.270">The </span><span begin="00:58.270" end="01:00.490">defenders </span><span begin="01:00.490" end="01:00.680">of </span><span begin="01:00.680" end="01:00.930">the </span><span begin="01:00.930" end="01:01.500">faith </span><span begin="01:01.500" end="01:01.680">we </span><span begin="01:01.680" end="01:02.090">are</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.520" end="01:04.739"><span begin="01:02.520" end="01:02.910"